    "Title": "Red Lvl. Contract: Defend ~mission(Objects)",
    "TitleKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_VH_Title_001",
    "DisplayTitle": "Red Lvl. Contract: Defend Fuel Tanks",
    "Description": "Urgent ship support needed at <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>. A known destructive criminal organization has been testing the waters with one of our clients\u2019 property for months, and has now raised hell by targeting the client\u2019s <EM4>~mission(Objects)</EM4>. These assets are highly valuable, so need to keep those safe at all costs \u2013 though we know it\u2019ll be no easy feat.\n\nI cannot stress enough how dangerous these guys are, so I wouldn\u2019t hesitate to <EM>bring backup</EM> to deal with them. If you and the assets make it out intact, we\u2019re offering a well-earned <EM4>~mission(ScripAmount) MG Scrip</EM4>  to the main contractor. \n\nBest of luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
    "DescriptionKey": "Foxwell_DefendDestructibleEntites_VH_Desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Urgent ship support needed at <EM4>Asteroid Mining Base</EM4>. A known destructive criminal organization has been testing the waters with one of our clients\u2019 property for months, and has now raised hell by targeting the client\u2019s <EM4>Fuel Tanks</EM4>. These assets are highly valuable, so need to keep those safe at all costs \u2013 though we know it\u2019ll be no easy feat.\n\nI cannot stress enough how dangerous these guys are, so I wouldn\u2019t hesitate to <EM>bring backup</EM> to deal with them. If you and the assets make it out intact, we\u2019re offering a well-earned <EM4>[ScripAmount] MG Scrip</EM4>  to the main contractor. \n\nBest of luck,\n\nKevin Walton\nDispatcher, Foxwell Enforcement\n'Security, Your Way'\n\nFoxwell Enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the UEE. We are always looking for new operators to join our family. If you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives.",
